[
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おめでとう夏葉！\r\n２次審査通過だ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "013",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030010,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "そう……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030010"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030020,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "本当に、よかったわ……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（まだ少し自分のやり方に悩んでいるようで\r\n心配だったけど、夏葉もこれで一安心できたかな）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "日々の努力を怠らない夏葉であれば\r\n必ず通過できると信じていたぞ",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030030,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……ありがとう\r\nでも『W.I.N.G.』まで、気を抜かずに頑張るわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さすが夏葉だな、もう先を見ているのか\r\nでも今日くらい、身体を休めてもいいんじゃないか？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030040,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "大丈夫よ\r\n立ち止まっている時間なんてないもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030050,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "この先に残っているのは実力のあるアイドルばかり……\r\n私も負けてられないわ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか。わかった\r\n俺も全力でサポートするぞ",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030060,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "何を言っているの\r\n当然でしょう？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私が努力するのはもちろんだけど、アナタの\r\n力がないと、私の活動は成り立たないんだから",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、任せてくれ！",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ、いつも以上に\r\n努力するのが楽しみになってきたわ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どうしてだ？",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "だって、考えてみなさい！　もっとステージに立てれば\r\n私の歌やダンスを、いろんな人に見てもらえる",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "その中で、最高のパフォーマンスができたら\r\nアイドルとして高みに近づいていると実感できるからよ！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。夏葉もアイドルらしくなってきたじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "何を言っているのよ\r\nまだまだこれからじゃない",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "それに……もっともっとトレーニングを重ねて、アイドルに\r\nふさわしい完璧な肉体をつくっていかないといけないわ！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030120"
  },
  {
    "id": 7013001030130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "さあ、やるわよプロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701300103/7013001030130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、そうだな！",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（やっぱりこういうところは相変わらずだな……\r\nでも、このまっすぐなひた向きさは夏葉にしかないものだ）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（俺も負けないくらい全力で頑張っていこう）",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]